{"id": "swebq0169", "pool": "swebq", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 398732849, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "aa7a8a6f2040793a4fe8dabcb6d10f2520887b0e0988d37809c3a27ef31575d8", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 3, "query": "what places are in the west midlands?", "input_path": "/data/bench_audio/swebq0169.wav", "input_sha256": "af52fce3fed68b0a456797fa7cda27264c402c65194d7b3547664bde0d463ec9", "input_samples": 32676, "input_s": 2.042, "n_real_chunks": 3, "score": 0.6993, "act": 0.9964, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "The West Midlands can mean either the West Midlands region of England or the West Midlands metropolitan county. West Midlands metropolitan county includes: Birmingham , Coventry , Wolverhampton , Dudley , Sandwell — e.g. West Bromwich, Smethwick, Oldbury , Solihull , Walsall The wider West Midlands region also includes places in: Herefordshire — e.g. Hereford , Shropshire — e.g. Worcester, Redditch, Kidderminster , West Midlands county — Birmingham, Coventry, Wolverhampton, etc.", "expert_answer": "The **West Midlands** can mean either the **West Midlands region of England** or the **West Midlands metropolitan county**.\n\n**West Midlands metropolitan county includes:**\n- **Birmingham**\n- **Coventry**\n- **Wolverhampton**\n- **Dudley**\n- **Sandwell** — e.g. West Bromwich, Smethwick, Oldbury\n- **Solihull**\n- **Walsall**\n\n**The wider West Midlands region also includes places in:**\n- **Herefordshire** — e.g. Hereford\n- **Shropshire** — e.g. Shrewsbury, Telford\n- **Staffordshire** — e.g. Stoke-on-Trent, Stafford, Lichfield\n- **Warwickshire** — e.g. Warwick, Stratford-upon-Avon, Rugby\n- **Worcestershire** — e.g. Worcester, Redditch, Kidderminster\n- **West Midlands county** — Birmingham, Coventry, Wolverhampton, etc.", "transcript": "What places are in the West Midlands?\n", "asr_s": 0.53, "expert_s": 5.66, "expert_input_samples": 32676, "expert_input_s": 2.042, "expert_input_sha256": "af52fce3fed68b0a456797fa7cda27264c402c65194d7b3547664bde0d463ec9", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 2.498, "relay_synth_ms": 23065, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 3, "feed_lag_max_ms": 833, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 2100, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0169_always_relay.wav", "sha256": "acf2e50d406713a9e1a900a73384abe60d692beaf070d596c6f963293ca46626", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 41.6}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0169_always_candidate.wav", "sha256": "f46eaab602e450de8b5a411aa880e62ee4a47bf02167fed1ef5e407fa679a427", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0169_always_stall.wav", "sha256": "ee85ada75c0defeb7f3512ba02238c19243f3440d61856dc3bdbb701ec0c7056", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 4.28}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.073, 1.132, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.074, 2.133, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 2.042, 2.204, 2.265, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.042, 3.119, 3.833, 0, 24000, 0], [4, 0, 4.042, 4.946, 5.692, 0, 24000, 0], [5, 0, 5.042, 5.769, 6.568, 0, 24000, 0], [6, 0, 6.042, 6.65, 7.522, 0, 30720, 1]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 2.042, "last_real_feed_done": 2.204, "onset": 3.833, "gate_read_done": 3.834, "fire": 3.834, "candidate_first_pcm": 3.833, "stall_note": 3.835, "stall_first_pcm": 4.875, "local_first_pcm": null, "wait_start": 7.522, "expert_req": 3.834, "expert_resp": 10.019, "relay_synth_start": 10.02, "relay_first_pcm": 10.886, "relay_synth_end": 33.085, "first_any_pcm": 3.833, "first_answer_pcm": 10.886, "session_end": 34.385}, "ttfa_answer_s": 8.844, "ttfa_any_s": 1.791}
{"id": "swebq0179", "pool": "swebq", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 249503600, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "aa7a8a6f2040793a4fe8dabcb6d10f2520887b0e0988d37809c3a27ef31575d8", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 3, "query": "when will the world end mayans?", "input_path": "/data/bench_audio/swebq0179.wav", "input_sha256": "fbe35ab923e41abd66aeecde70a25430cc0957dc6155752b581862fcb91b050a", "input_samples": 28960, "input_s": 1.81, "n_real_chunks": 2, "score": 0.8151, "act": 0.9939, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "The Mayan calendar did not predict the end of the world. The famous date was December 21, 2012, which marked the end of a major cycle in the Maya Long Count calendar—similar to an odometer rolling over—not an apocalypse. So the answer is: not according to the Mayans; the world was not predicted to end.", "expert_answer": "The **Mayan calendar did not predict the end of the world**.\n\nThe famous date was **December 21, 2012**, which marked the end of a major cycle in the Maya Long Count calendar—similar to an odometer rolling over—not an apocalypse.\n\nSo the answer is: **not according to the Mayans; the world was not predicted to end.**", "transcript": "When will the world end, Mayans?\n", "asr_s": 0.45, "expert_s": 2.37, "expert_input_samples": 28960, "expert_input_s": 1.81, "expert_input_sha256": "fbe35ab923e41abd66aeecde70a25430cc0957dc6155752b581862fcb91b050a", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 1.709, "relay_synth_ms": 10704, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 1, "feed_lag_max_ms": 354, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 354, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0179_always_relay.wav", "sha256": "ab5e789d52cb5faf0298c70b35a63615bf0176896333f6cee3efcdc4090344c8", "sr":